hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"68","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Qais se — jo Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ke qass [waiz] the — unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne mujh se kaha: Us qaum ke paas jao jo Ramazan ke mahine mein logon ko namaz padhati hai, phir unhen hukm do ke wo [surah] Izas Samaunshaqqat [Al-Inshiqaq] aur [surah] Iqra Bismi Rabbikallazi Khalaq [Al-Alaq] mein sajda karen. Beshak Abdur Rahman bin Auf ke bete ne mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke Aap ne 'us mein sajda kiya.'"
"69","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Muhajir se riwayat hai: Ke unhon ne Zuhri ko Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se kehte hue suna — murad sahw ke do sajde hain: 'Dono salam se pehle hain.' [Rawi ne] kaha: To Umar ne inkar kiya, aur kaha: Hamen is ki khabar do, aye Ibn Shihab — Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se — murad sahw ke do sajde hain."
"70","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne '[surah] Izas Samaunshaqqat [Al-Inshiqaq] mein sajda kiya.'"
"71","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne '[surah] Izas Samaunshaqqat [Al-Inshiqaq] mein sajda kiya.'"
